cert.pem: the root CA certificates Mozilla trusts for TLS servers, as
extracted from Mozilla's certdata.txt by the curl project
(https://curl.se/docs/caextract.html). Licence: MPL-2.0 (Mozilla's
data; approved for ravynOS 2026-10-24). Installed as /etc/ssl/cert.pem,
where curl, fetch and Mbed TLS users look by default.

  Source:  https://curl.se/ca/cacert.pem (Mozilla data of 2026-10-20)
  SHA-256: 796f1389bfea13c0ed78f663b765baaff54a508e5483786bd6ece73c5e3e3cbe

To update, fetch the file and its .sha256 again, check the sum, and
replace cert.pem.
